dle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8077fc98623397d188f2f8b4f074d41a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@am_o0zz/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f28e743e/uploads/origins/64b45b88-4458-46f6-883a-c51fd528a49e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68012b36514080bb2a21cc1444901413", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f28e743e/uploads/origins/64b45b88-4458-46f6-883a-c51fd528a49e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68012b36514080bb2a21cc1444901413, https://si.imgix.net/f28e743e/uploads/origins/64b45b88-4458-46f6-883a-c51fd528a49e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=818033bbd2dded30dcaffb31b224ff72 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f28e743e/uploads/origins/64b45b88-4458-46f6-883a-c51fd528a49e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=deab6728694401454b945b1197c339c4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I was hoping to get a 16:9 drawing for my character, named Plume! If not okay, an icon version would be fine~ \n\nHe is a “cute masculine” body type and is based on a light blue and white parakeet bird, with a short light blue haircut that has 90s style bangs and sticks out at the bottom, fluffy wings on his head in place of ears, small fangs, large gold round glasses and a large hooded jacket that has sleeves like feathers, oval blush that is permanently on his cheeks, a beauty mark right by his left eye, along with shoes that resemble a bird's claws and feet. There is also a small patch of black speckles on his jacket shoulders, like in the references~\n\nI would love any sort of pose or extra details/ accessories of the costume that you're inspired to draw if you accept my request, and for the colors palette they are mostly shades of light blues, white, green for the eyes, peach for the permanent blush, and gold for accents! Also a transparent version as well if it's okay!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bmXwr4XFITooFTuWDXr3FFZn_TCCjBg9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@am_o0zz/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da077138f54c5f929745d3d9d1d24398", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da077138f54c5f929745d3d9d1d24398, https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f00ad00b0102588fc23e281c9efa7f6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25e66b7b5aa7b0344f9798420154ac9a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n\nあなたの画風はかわいいです!私のOCを描いてくれませんか？彼女はストロベリーという豚の女の子です。\n\nどんなポーズでも、どんな表情でもOKです!\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-_hu4byNW9SzdmArGwF5u9VV59EFRC_z\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-_hu4byNW9SzdmArGwF5u9VV59EFRC_z", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@am_o0zz/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/67c39fb8/uploads/origins/4a05925c-e5a2-45d2-96b0-d5aecd72146c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dd0b1782694aa877290517506a47209", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67c39fb8/uploads/origins/4a05925c-e5a2-45d2-96b0-d5aecd72146c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dd0b1782694aa877290517506a47209, https://si.imgix.net/67c39fb8/uploads/origins/4a05925c-e5a2-45d2-96b0-d5aecd72146c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6813024ee2e42e9bfbb8f31c0b86dc37 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67c39fb8/uploads/origins/4a05925c-e5a2-45d2-96b0-d5aecd72146c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0af4cf46eb54f9cd516e78ab3298928 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n\nあなたの作品を見て、私のVTuberを描いていただけませんか？綺麗なピンクのロングヘアーです。構図はクリスマスがテーマでお願いします!\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rzWRC0t6P6Kl6Zi7_XL7vbLPpIEZ6Whz?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@am_o0zz/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/825d50b6/uploads/origins/eb13781e-1cae-48d3-8fa1-5967d8891a5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59cb340a4feaa82634c36871d15f4555", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/825d50b6/uploads/origins/eb13781e-1cae-48d3-8fa1-5967d8891a5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59cb340a4feaa82634c36871d15f4555, https://si.imgix.net/825d50b6/uploads/origins/eb13781e-1cae-48d3-8fa1-5967d8891a5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7861f5f4bf8c4b2419375be74e09b62 2x, https://si.imgix.net/825d50b6/uploads/origins/eb13781e-1cae-48d3-8fa1-5967d8891a5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6273162672e3c4c610a3afb76b8d1096 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私はあなたのアートワークが大好きで、私のVtuberの1つを描くことができるだろうと思っています。スケジュールアートとプロフィール写真に使用する予定です。スズランの花を持って喜んでいるところを描いてほしいです。ポーズはおまかせします。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nVtuberと花の参考： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gGOZnuCllOcAX6T0hgpClF0y_UGXNgMS?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@am_o0zz/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f2d4a437/uploads/origins/f7bcffb7-327b-4497-93ef-b14af144a3ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc8c2a4b7fc76dbbe949086163ff36b9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f2d4a437/uploads/origins/f7bcffb7-327b-4497-93ef-b14af144a3ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc8c2a4b7fc76dbbe949086163ff36b9, https://si.imgix.net/f2d4a437/uploads/origins/f7bcffb7-327b-4497-93ef-b14af144a3ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c439715506748f32afe0705ef3f807b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f2d4a437/uploads/origins/f7bcffb7-327b-4497-93ef-b14af144a3ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9d0f877cfa05db9b3f30b62decf4aac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\n女の子1人のイラストを依頼させてください\n\n髪型\nセミロング\nハーフツイン\n薄いピンク\nにんじんの形のヘアピン\n\n目\n髪色より少し濃いピンク\n\n服装\nうさぎっぽいイメージの白いふわふわした服\n\n表情やポーズ、背景などの細かい部分はお任せいたします\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@am_o0zz/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/118f3562/uploads/origins/e2266315-216e-4d76-a749-5267c2fe2005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aeb6e7435ba26cd71ded772086c07a79", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/118f3562/uploads/origins/e2266315-216e-4d76-a749-5267c2fe2005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aeb6e7435ba26cd71ded772086c07a79, https://si.imgix.net/118f3562/uploads/origins/e2266315-216e-4d76-a749-5267c2fe2005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec5d53a14a9b371127c118d393446981 2x, https://si.imgix.net/118f3562/uploads/origins/e2266315-216e-4d76-a749-5267c2fe2005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a08fe92c592b164248e02edce17e8f23 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\nとても可愛らしい絵柄に惹かれ、\nリクエストお送りさせて頂きました✨\n\n良ければうちの子を描いて頂きたいです♡\nうさぎと苺がイメージの女の子です🐰🍓\n\n用途 → SNSアイコンなどの完全個人利用\n\n髪型 → 毛先内巻きのツインテール\n(白いぽんぽんのヘアゴムと、前髪横の三角ヘアピンがチャームポイントです◎)\n\n表情 → 少し涙目な感じが理想です！\n\n\n構図や服装(アレンジ可)などは、\nお好きなように描いて頂けたら嬉しいです♡\n\n詳しいキャラ詳細は下記のリンク先よりご確認いただけますと幸いです！\n\nまた納品の際、背景とレイヤー分けされたものも頂けますと嬉しいです(*ᴗˬᴗ)⁾⁾\n\nご縁がありますように✨\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-L3MFHsgyHUGXGx8EVa5jr